rooms_desc ({"You stand in a small, yet comfortable living room.  The room has a cheeryatmosphere, with the white plush carpet soft beneath your feet, and brightly painted walls.  There's a fireplace here, currently not in usewhich would provide a cheery fire on cold days.  The whole room has abright, clean atmosphere.  For the moment, the source of illumination isa gold halogen lamp shining brightly in the corner.",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
